<body>
<div class="print-hint interactive-only">
  <strong>Tip for best print quality:</strong> When printing, check "Background graphics" in your print settings to preserve all brand colours.
</div>
<div class="report-wrapper">
  <div class="report-header">
    <div class="header-top">
      <div class="header-left">
        <div class="prepared-for">Prepared Exclusively For</div>
        <h1>__BUYER_NAME__</h1>
        <div class="property-line"><span>__ADDRESS__</span><span style="opacity:0.4">|</span><span>MLS __MLS__</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="header-right">
        <div class="badge">__DATE__</div>
        <div class="presented-by"><strong>Presented by:</strong> __AGENT_NAME__, Realtor<br><strong>Report Prepared by TheFunders.ca</strong><br>FSRA Lic. M23001234</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="photo-strip">
    <img src="__PHOTO__" alt="__ADDRESS__" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.parentElement.style.background='linear-gradient(135deg,#24352c 0%,#19231d 100%)';">
    <div class="photo-overlay">
      <div class="price-tag">__PRICE_FMT__ <span>CAD</span></div>
      <div class="specs"><span>__BEDS__ Bed</span><span>__BATHS__ Bath</span><span>__SQFT__ sqft</span><span>__TYPE__</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="page-section page-1">
    <div class="section-header"><div class="section-number">1</div><h2>Your Financing Roadmap</h2></div>
    <div class="metrics-grid">
      <div class="metric-card"><div class="label">List Price</div><div class="value">__PRICE_FMT__</div><div class="sub">Listed today</div></div>
      <div class="metric-card"><div class="label">Income Required</div><div class="value sage">__INCOME__<span style="font-size:14px;font-weight:500">/yr</span></div><div class="sub">Based on __DP__% down, __GDS__% GDS</div></div>
      <div class="metric-card"><div class="label">Est. Monthly Payment</div><div class="value">__MONTHLY_TOTAL__<span style="font-size:14px;font-weight:500">/mo</span></div><div class="sub">Incl. tax, heat & condo fees</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="rate-panel">
      <div class="rate-panel-header">Current Mortgage Rates &mdash; Updated Weekly<span style="margin-left:auto;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;color:var(--forest-muted);">Best rates highlighted</span></div>
      <table class="rate-table"><thead><tr><th>Term</th><th>Rate</th><th>Lender</th><th>Monthly</th><th>5-Yr Interest</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>__RATES_ROWS__</tbody></table>
      <div class="rate-insight"><div><strong>__BEST_RATE_TERM__ is your sweet spot:</strong> At __BEST_RATE__%, you save <strong>$__BEST_SAVE_VS_5YR__/month</strong> vs. 5-Year Fixed. Assumes __DP__% down (__DP_FMT__), __AMORT__-year amortization.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="dp-panel">
      <div class="dp-panel-header"><span>Down Payment Impact</span><span class="dp-value" id="dpDisplay">__DP__% &mdash; __DP_FMT__</span></div>
      <div class="dp-slider-wrap interactive-only">
        <input type="range" min="5" max="35" step="5" value="__DP__" class="dp-slider" id="dpSlider">
        <div class="dp-labels"><span>5%</span><span>10%</span><span>15%</span><span>20%</span><span>25%</span><span>30%</span><span>35%</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="dp-details">
        <div class="dp-detail"><div><strong>CMHC Insurance</strong></div><div class="dp-num __CMHC_CLASS__" id="cmhcDisplay">__CMHC__</div><div class="dp-sub" id="cmhcSub">__CMHC_SUB__</div></div>
        <div class="dp-detail"><div><strong>Total Cash to Close</strong></div><div class="dp-num" id="cashDisplay">__CASH_CLOSE__</div><div class="dp-sub">Down + closing costs</div></div>
        <div class="dp-detail"><div><strong>Loan Amount</strong></div><div class="dp-num" id="loanDisplay">__LOAN__</div><div class="dp-sub">Principal + CMHC if any</div></div>
        <div class="dp-detail"><div><strong>Monthly (__BEST_RATE_TERM__)</strong></div><div class="dp-num sage" id="monthlyDisplay">__MONTHLY_MORT__</div><div class="dp-sub">Principal + interest only</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="qual-panel">
      <div class="qual-panel-header">Quick Qualification Snapshot</div>
      <div class="qual-grid">
        <div class="qual-row"><span>Minimum Gross Income</span><span>__INCOME__/year</span></div>
        <div class="qual-row"><span>Minimum Down Payment</span><span>__DP_FMT__ (__DP__%)</span></div>
        <div class="qual-row"><span>Gross Debt Service (GDS)</span><span style="color:var(--sage);">__GDS__%</span></div>
        <div class="qual-row"><span>Total Debt Service (TDS)</span><span style="color:var(--sage);">__TDS__%</span></div>
        <div class="qual-row"><span>Stress Test Rate</span><span>__STRESS_RATE__ (contract + 2%)</span></div>
        <div class="qual-row"><span>Amortization</span><span>__AMORT__ years</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="qual-note"><strong>Stress Test:</strong> Lenders qualify you at __STRESS_RATE__ even though your actual rate is __BEST_RATE__%. This ensures you can afford payments if rates rise. Your payment at the stress-test rate would be __STRESS_PAYMENT__/month.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="page-divider"></div>
  <div class="page-section">
    <div class="section-header"><div class="section-number">2</div><h2>Buy vs. Rent: The Wealth Builder</h2></div>
    <div class="bvr-grid">
      <div class="bvr-card buy">
        <div class="bvr-title">Buy This Home</div>
        <div class="bvr-row"><span class="bvr-label">Mortgage Payment (__BEST_RATE_TERM__)</span><span class="bvr-val">__MONTHLY_MORT__</span></div>
        <div class="bvr-row"><span class="bvr-label">Property Tax</span><span class="bvr-val">__TAX_MO__</span></div>
        <div class="bvr-row"><span class="bvr-label">Condo / Maintenance Fees</span><span class="bvr-val">__CONDO__</span></div>
        <div class="bvr-row"><span class="bvr-label">Home Insurance</span><span class="bvr-val">__INS__</span></div>
